{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sX8CuNyRhH1795412077.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>兩間電力公司宣布，明年將撥款支援弱勢社群。</p><p></p><p>其中中電宣布將撥款2.5億元，當中基層家庭電費補助撥款將增加1,000萬元、至6,000萬元，預計9.3萬個家庭受惠，比現時多2萬個。另外，撥款向合資格基層家庭送出約一萬部節能冷風機，改善炎熱天氣下的居住環境，並資助有需要家庭以「一換一」方式，更換更省電的家電。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ELECTRICITY-1300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TaI8ZEXyqF1795412069.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>港燈就宣布將撥款7,800萬元，支援弱勢社群減輕能源開支壓力，並會延續劏房租戶電費津貼等計劃。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ELECTRICITY-1300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026MlMvhtxkb31795412072.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>立法會環境事務委員會明天下午將會討論兩電周年電費檢討。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:50:39.309056+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T04:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:05:51.676410+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T05:44:05.966865+00:00","content_hash":"6170b50074565b78b9f8d4be4ed445f4fb376918195de59889f57bab0ef07c35","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:50:39.309056+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}